 are \\(Abridged\\) \\[Revised\\] \\[Again\\] by Adam Long\, Daniel Singer\
 , and Jess Winfield\, with new revisions by Daniel Singer and Jess Winfiel
 d. Following popular summer performances at di Rosa Center for Contemporar
 y Art’s Shakespeare Summer Stroll\, the production returns indoors to th
 e Napa Valley College Performing Arts Center Studio Theatre for another hi
 larious sprint through all 37 of Shakespeare’s plays. \n\nDirected by T
 heater Arts faculty member Olivia Cowell and starring Theater Arts faculty
