BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Votes\, Voice and Victory:115th Anniversary of California Women’
 s Suffrage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T140000
UID:260928BWYy3FyJSEyNT8u3dmB8FA
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun and inspiring day celebrating the **11
 5th anniversary of California Women's Suffrage**!\n\nCheck out information
 al tables hosted by Sonoma State University Library\, Sonoma County Public
  Library\, National Women’s History Alliance\, Sonoma County Historical 
 Society\, Saturday Afternoon Club\, Sonoma Valley Historical Society and t
 he League of Women Voters for Sonoma County.\n\nHear from our guest speake
 r\, **Molly Murphy MacGregor**\, Co-Founder of the National Women’s His
 tory Association (NWHA)\, and watch the fascinating video by Wild West Wom
 en Inc. called ***"California Women Win the Vote"*.**\n\nIt’s a great c
 hance to learn\, celebrate\, and connect with the history of women’s rig
 hts in California. See you there!\n\nFree parking is available in the park
 ing lot behind the barracks.\n\nCalifornia State Parks supports equal acce
 ss. Visitors with disabilities who need assistance\, email Deborah Lee wi
 th the tagline equal access deborah.lee@parks.ca.gov.
