DESCRIPTION:🍄🎧 MARK FARINA RETURNS TO THE MYSTIC! 🎧🍄\n\nA true
  pioneer of house music and the creator of the legendary Mushroom Jazz sou
 nd\, MARK FARINA takes over the Mystic Theatre on Saturday\, October 10!\n
 \nGet ready for a seamless journey through deep house\, jazzy grooves\, hi
 p-hop-infused beats and dance-floor energy from one of electronic music’
 s most celebrated DJs.\n\nCome early and plan to dance all night! 🔊✨\
 n\nMARK FARINA 📅 Saturday\, October 10 🚪 Doors & Show: 8 PM 📍 Mys
 tic Theatre | Petaluma
