 wines from up to 100 established and emerging wineries\, along with delici
 ous bites from local restaurants\, caterers\, and food producers. Guests c
 an dress up for an evening of tasting and celebration while discovering th
 e winners of the Sweepstakes Wines and enjoying culinary creations from th
