 s a dynamic sound ranging from cinematic and atmospheric dark wave arrange
 ments to high-energy rock. Joining them on stage are Joe Shotwell on drums
 \, Alan Parks on electric and upright bass\, and Frank Acosta on guitar an
 d violin.\n\nThe band will showcase a full set of original music\, includi
 ng their recent single "A Kiss Like This."\n\n**Event Details:**\n\n**What
 :** Magenta Ray Live Performance\n\n**When:** Saturday\, Oct. 10\, 2026 at
  8 p.m.\n\n**Where:** The Garden\, 1500 1st St.\, Napa\, Calif. 94559\n\n*
 *Tickets & Admission:** Free admission
