 teely Dan\, and more!). \n\nWe'll be in full four piece form featuring ba
 nd founder and songwriter Jason E Davies on guitar and vocals\, Travis Tha
 yer on keys\, sax\, and vocals\, Rob Neidel on bass and vocals\, and Chris
