 onoma County’s most beloved gathering spots.\n\nSample Pinot Noir\, Char
 donnay\, and Sparkling Wines from 60+ of California’s top producers\, al
 l in an open-air\, walk-around format that celebrates the best of wine cou
 ntry.\n\nEnjoy VIP early access from 12–1pm\, followed by General Admiss
