 gardens. The event features a salsa class\, food and wine available for pu
 rchase\, and a high-energy performance by the California Salsa Swing Band\
 , whose members represent countries across Latin America. Led by Wally "El
  Timbalero\," the band honors the rich traditions of Latin music and pays 
 tribute to icons like Tito Puente. Bring friends and family to enjoy music
 \, dancing\, delicious bites\, and a welcoming community atmosphere. All a
 re invited to celebrate\, connect\, and experience the spirit of Hispanic 
 Heritage.
