BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
UID:2608241Miw2j4CSkidr73eel-7WA
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T103000
UID:2607287TjOE8P3FEmtiPRVlQnTqA
DESCRIPTION:Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.\n\nIn OA\, membe
 rs experience spiritual\, emotional\, and physical recovery by practicing 
 the Twelve Steps and living by their spiritual principles—one day at a t
 ime.\n\nOvereaters Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support ea
 ch other in recovering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you f
 eel you have a problem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your b
 ackground\, beliefs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person meetings
  at 9:30 on Sunday mornings at Church of the Nazarene\, 18980 Arnold Drive
 \, Sonoma\, CA (a small room directly off of parking lot\; look for the si
 gn posted) and newcomers are always welcome.\n\nYou may view all North Bay
  OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.h
 tml\n\nOA is not a diet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have 
 different plans of eating.\n\nOA does not endorse any specific food plan.
  \n\nVisit: https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\nFind a meeting: https://www.no
 rthbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Church of the Nazarene  (a small room directly off of parking lot
 \; look for the sign posted)
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
