DESCRIPTION:Experience the vibrant sounds of the new SSU Community Concert
  Band\, led by conductor Dr. Andy Collinsworth\, alongside the electrifyin
 g Blue Devils Winds under Dr. Kaitlin Bove. This dynamic program features 
 Rossano Galante’s soaring overture Colorado Rockies\, Thom Ritter George
 ’s classic band work First Suite in F\, SSU trumpet professor Dan Norris
  performing Alexander Goedecke’s dazzling Concert Etude\, op. 49\, Omar 
 Thomas’ jazz infused Forward/Still\, Ira Hearshen’s arrangement of Sym
 phonic Dances from Fiddler on the Roof\, and John Philip Sousa’s soaring
  march The Invincible Eagle. Join us for an unforgettable evening of music
 al brilliance at the heart of campus life!
LOCATION:Sonoma State University - Joan and Sanford I. Weill Hall
