DESCRIPTION:October 15 — Wine Dinner | Sarasota\, FL\n\nMichael’s On E
 ast | 5–9 PM \n\nExperience Sonoma wine country in Sarasota with a speci
 al Gundlach Bundschu wine dinner at Michael’s On East. The evening will 
 feature a selection of wines from our historic Rhinefarm estate paired wit
 h a multi-course culinary experience\, bringing together great food\, expr
 essive wines\, and the stories behind six generations of Bundschu family w
 inemaking. Join us for an evening that’s equal parts wine education\, st
 orytelling\, and good old-fashioned GUNBUN hospitality. \n\nLEARN MORE
LOCATION:Gundland Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/wine-dinner-micahels-on-east/
