DESCRIPTION:RHINEFARM AFTERHOURS | 3RD FRI EACH MONTH | 5-8P \n\nAn evenin
 g series dedicated to wine\, music and community. Each month brings a new 
 wine theme\, a guest host and vinyl sets from our friend\, Andy Cabic. Tic
 kets include a glass of our featured wine and a legendary Rhinefarm sunset
 . Additional wine and food available for purchase. \n\nDATES: APR 17\, MAY
  15 JUN 19\, JUL 17\, AUG 21\, SEP 18\, OCT 16 \n\nTIME: 5-8p \n\nLOCATION
 : Gundlach Bundschu Winery \\(Tasting Room Courtyard\\) \n\nTICKETS: Free 
 for Bacchus Club members / $20pp and includes a welcome glass of our featu
 red wine. This event is family friendly. Free for guests under 21 years ol
 d. \n\nBACCHUS CLUB: Log into your club-linked Tock account to RSVP. If tw
 o \\(2\\) complimentary tickets do not auto-apply at checkout\, please che
 ck your email for a special code or contact us. \n\n 
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/rhinefarm-afterhours/2026-10-16/
