BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dia de Muertos at Jack London State Historic Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T170000
UID:26093013rZWApPRUmgqw0bJW3SUA
DESCRIPTION:In recognition of Día de Muertos\, Jack London State Historic
  Park will present two *ofrendas* in the House of Happy Walls Museum from 
 Oct. 4 to Nov. 6\, 2026.\n\nDia de Muertos\, or Day of the Dead\, is a tra
 dition that began in Mexican and other Latino cultures.  An ofrenda\, Spa
 nish for ‘offering\,’ is an altar created to honor and welcome the mem
 ory of those who have died.\n\nThe Legacy Ofrenda will honor writer and ad
 venturer Jack London\, Charmian London\, and other individuals connected t
 o the history of the property. Through photographs\, reproductions\, tradi
 tional elements of an ofrenda\, and carefully selected symbolic objects\, 
 the installation will reflect Jack and Charmian's partnership\, writing an
 d travels\, their life at Beauty Ranch\, their connection to the land\, an
 d the legacies they left behind.\n\nThe Community Ofrenda will be a shared
 \, participatory offering. Visitors\, locals\, volunteers\, Board members\
 , and employees can contribute a small photograph\, written name\, memory\
 , drawing or message honoring someone who has passed away – including a 
 beloved pet. \n\nThe installation will grow throughout October as more pe
 ople participate.  Materials will be available at the display for visitor
 s who would like to join the celebration and contribute a name\, memory or
  even a drawing of their loved one.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/dia-de-muertos-2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Nights in The Lounge w/ DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T010000
UID:260923xyBQpBfcnkauqWjnxtq7hA
DESCRIPTION:Chill out every Friday night with DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie
  spinning live vibes in The Lounge!\n\nFRIDAY NIGHTS IN THE LOUNGE DJ Oso 
 Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Música Urbana Friday nigh
 ts go late at Barrel Proof Lounge.\n\nEvery Friday at 10 PM\, DJ Oso Perez
  & DJ Doc Boogie take over the lounge with a late-night mix of Hip Hop\, R
 eggaeton and Música Urbana \, keeping the front room moving into the nigh
 t. Oso is back behind the decks at Barrel Proof\, but this time we're swit
 ching things up. The focus is Hip Hop\, Reggaeton and Latin urban sounds 
 — with Oso and Doc Boogie working the room and keeping the party moving 
 all night.\n\nAnd there's more happening under the same roof.\n\nStart you
 r night with Friday Night Comedy in the Main Room\, then at 10 PM Barrel P
 roof splits into two completely different late-night parties:\n\n THE LOU
 NGE — 10 PM DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músi
 ca Urbana Dancing\, drinks and late-night Friday energy.\n\n THE BIG STAG
 E — 10 PM Late Night Karaoke Grab the mic and take over the Barrel Proof
  stage.\n\nMove between the rooms. Dance for a while. Sing something quest
 ionable. Grab another drink. Repeat as necessary.\n\nEVERY FRIDAY NIGHT  
 DJs start at 10 PM  Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave • Downtown Sa
 nta Rosa  DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie  Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músic
 a Urbana  Late Night Karaoke in the Main Room  21+\n\nCome for comedy. S
 tay for the party.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge Comedy • Live Music • Karaok
 e • DJs • Events\n\nDowntown Santa Rosa
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-nights-in-the-lounge-w-dj-oso-pere
 z-dj-doc-boogie-tickets-2002100950839?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
