 d the threats to our democracy and neighbors are real and they are scary. 
 On this NO KINGS\, let’s show the White House something that will truly 
 scare them: a nationwide mass mobilization of citizens ready to vote early
  and make this election TOO BIG TO RIG!\n\nOn October 17th\, we encourage 
 you to come in a vote-themed costume or with a sign ready to find your pac
 k and howl for democracy!\n\n👻 VOTING themed costumes encouraged\, but 
 please come with or without a costume and any NO KINGS signs are welcome!\
 n\n🍬 Trick-or-treat at community tables \\(voter resources \\+ lots of 
 candy & treats\\)\n\n📸 Strike a pose at the Village Voters Photo Booth\
 n\n🎤 Special speakers will raise our spirits!\n\n🚶 Then grab your gh
 ouls and join the community march\n\nMake your voice heard and get ready t
 o howl for Democracy! Let’s make this election TOO BIG TO RIG!
LOCATION:Oxbow Commons
