 and create your own artwork to take home. No experience is needed\, and al
 l materials are provided.\n\nSGVCC will also be introducing their New Fall
  Classes\, After-School Enrichment Programs\, Creative Try-Outs\, and the 
 Figure Drawing Studio.\n\nThe Maker Space Opening is designed for all ages
 \, though young children should be accompanied by an adult. Suggested don
 ation: $25 per person\, with all proceeds supporting the Community Center
 ’s arts programming. Light refreshments will be served.\n\nCome get crea
 tive\, explore the new space\, and discover what’s ahead at the Maker Sp
 ace! We hope to see you at the Center soon!\n\nQuestions? Contact: dfogel@
 sgvcc.org
