BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Festa Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
UID:2610054BYEGpf0Ukmw0mNA7V14hw
DESCRIPTION:Join us as Nichelini Family Winery celebrates 136 years of win
 emaking heritage!\n\nEnjoy a special anniversary tasting experience\, expl
 ore our historic property\, and take advantage of featured winery specials
  throughout the day. Each tasting includes a commemorative anniversary win
 e glass to take home.\n\nDoors open at 11:00 AM\, with the final tasting b
 eginning at 4:00 PM.\n\nThroughout the day\, guests are invited to join gu
 ided tours of the property led by 4th-generation Nichelini family member P
 inky Dahn\, offering a unique look into the history\, stories\, and tradit
 ions that have shaped Nichelini Winery for more than a century.\n\nWe welc
 ome outside food\, so pack a picnic and relax on the grounds while enjoyin
 g the beauty of Chiles Valley. Wine will be available for purchase by the 
