DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the opening of EAMES & EAMES at The MAC with an aft
 ernoon of bebop jazz\, Charbay cocktails\, and light bites\, surrounded by
  the visionary designs of Charles & Ray Eames. Enjoy private access to thi
 s original exhibition from the Eames Institute of Infinite Curiousity\, vi
 ew our lobby exhibitions\, and shop our Museum Store's curated collection 
 including design books\, mid-century themed decor and Eames-inspired gifts
 . \n\nLimited capacity - reserve now. Individual Members may purchase one
  ticket at $25 each\; Family\, MAC Pack and Patron Members may purchase 2 
 tickets at $25 each. Join the Museum now!
