DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T213000
UID:261010_RCV2xfIBUGWNXTUo5bnvw
DESCRIPTION:4TH Annual American Roots Mini-Fest Downtown Sonoma - 3 bands 
 in The Alley at Murphys\, Sat\, Oct 24 2:30-9:30\, Outdoors\, all day... H
 attie Craven\, Back pOrchEstra and The Wild Premonitions.\n\n"Something Ne
 w and Something Familiar"... Roots Rock\, Americana\, Country Blues\, West
 ern Swing\, Cajun\, and New Orleans music...\n\nno cover\, Tip the perform
 ers! $10+ donation suggested\n\nHattie Craven 2:30-4:00\n\nHattie Craven h
 as lived and breathed music since her early years with her father\, award-
 winning performer Joe Craven. Hattie draws musical influences from Amy Win
 ehouse\, Joni Mitchell\, James Brown\, Louis Prima\, and so many more. She
  effectively reimagines traditional folk\, bluegrass\, country\, jazz and 
 pop\,\n\ncreating new music that is truly her own. Hattie is also a fine w
 riter of original songs that explore themes of love\, loss and resilience.
  https://www.hattiecraven.com\n\nBack pOrchEstra: 4:45-6:45\n\nSemi-Acoust
 ic Original Indie Rock & the American Roots\n\nthat inspired it: Country B
 lues\, Cajun\, Roots Rock\,\n\nAmericana\, Singer/Songwriter music with ri
 ch tones:\n\nCandy Girard\, Tim Eschliman\, Mark Larson\, Jen Rund\, Luis 
 Rodriguez... originals and reworked classics by Hank Williams\, Taj Mahal\
 , Dan Hicks\, NRBQ\, JJ Cale\, Big Al Amderson\, Big Bill Broonzy\, Bob Wi
 lls\, Jimmy Reed\, Joseph & Cleome Falcon... recent single: https://orcd.c
 o/7jjvmmx ... "What Does Your Heart Say?" - a Breezy west coast rock\, a h
 opeful idealistic Americana love song duet\, celebrating the new "Stories 
 In The Heart" album\, listen now!: https://orcd.co/5xga7nr\n\nhttps://www.
 BackpOrchEstra.com\n\nThe Wild Premonitions: 7:30-9:30\n\nA never-before s
 ummit of players... an experiment of many genres: Rock\, Blues\, Jazz\, Fu
 nk\, Zydeco... Mike Rinta\, Tim Eschliman\, Roy Blumenfeld\, Kevin Zuffi a
 nd Ian Lamson... players from The Blues Project\, Rhythmtown-Jive\, Louisi
 ana Time Travelers\, Sly Stone\, Commander Cody & His Western Airmen.\n\n4
 64 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA 95476 (707) 935-0660\n\nSongs from all over the 
 map!...\n\nsee also\n\nRoy Blumenfeld: https://bluesproject.net/bios/\n\nh
 ttp://www.rhythmtown-jive.com\n\nhttps://www.mikerintamusic.com\n\nhttps:/
 /timeschliman.com/LouisianaTimeTravelers.html\n\nCommander Cody & His West
 ern Airmen YouTube Playlist: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSGImH0Ow8
 0I&si=ib9D\\_7PpEiKJ2rFn\n\nPreview the music:\n\nThe Blues Project\, Hatt
 ie Craven\, Back pOrchEstra \, Roy Blumenfeld\, Rhythmtown-Jive\, Mike Rin
 ta -\n\n4TH Annual American Roots Mini-Fest Playlists:\n\n... on youTube:\
 n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEi6QQx2MsMM\n\n...on Spotify:\n
