BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Halloween Trick-or-Treat at Charlie's Acres
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T143000
UID:261004Pl61VyhM-EaKVAWpi28ntQ
DESCRIPTION:**Here’s what awaits you this Halloween at Charlie’s Acres
 !**\n\nJoin us for a day of festive fun\, sweet treats\, and unforgettable
  moments with our animal residents. Costumes are welcome at our annual Hal
 loween Celebration!\n\n**\\-Treat the Animals:** Take a spooky stroll arou
 nd the sanctuary loop in costume and hand out treats to our friendly anima
 l residents while learning their rescue stories.\n\n**\\-Scavenger Hunt Ad
 venture:** Kids can explore the sanctuary\, search for clues\, and discove
 r fun animal facts along the way.\n\n**\\-Pumpkin Smash for the Pigs:** He
 lp us smash pumpkins and watch the pigs bob for apples — it’s always a
  crowd favorite!\n\n**\\-Vegan Treats & Goodies:** Enjoy a candy treat bag
  and other goodies.\n\n**\\-Cruelty-Free Carnival Food:** Treat yourself t
 o plant-based carnival food for purchase from Vegan Circus Food Truck\, in
 cluding a special 'chicken' sandwich sponsored by Daring.\n\n**\\-Games & 
 Crafts Galore:** Play fun games and decorate your very own wooden pumpkin 
 to take home.\n\nWe'll be hosting this event rain or shine! Proceeds from 
 this event benefit the lifelong care of our 150 rescued animal residents\,
  humane education programs for schools\, and emergency response. Charlie's
  Acres provides a sanctuary for rescued farmed animals\, fostering compass
 ion and appreciation for these intelligent beings through education while 
 empowering people to make kinder\, more sustainable choices.\n\nEntry time
 s every 15 minutes between 11:00 am and 12:00 pm! Tickets are limited\; ge
 t yours today at charliesacres.org!
LOCATION:Charlie's Acres Farm Sanctuary
URL:https://www.charliesacres.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
