BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creative Photography Workshop at Jack London State Historic Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T150000
UID:260930GqlBXWz1REamC3daG0kSDw
DESCRIPTION:Join professional photographers Susan and Neil Silverman\, www
 .silvermansphotography.com\, for an inspiring\, hands-on exploration of yo
 ur phone camera’s creative potential.\n\nThe first half of the class wil
 l be held in the House of Happy Walls Museum.  The instructors will demon
 strate camera settings\, creative features\, and practical techniques that
  will help you make the most of the camera you carry every day. The demons
 trations are designed to teach how the camera works and to inspire your ey
 e for composition\, light\, and storytelling.\n\nAfter a short lunch break
 \, the group will move to Beauty Ranch to photograph a variety of subjects
  while practicing the techniques just learned. Discover new photographic t
 echniques and creative possibilities while you experience and appreciate t
 he remarkable beauty\, history\, and atmosphere of Jack London State Histo
 ric Park. It’s the perfect setting to experiment\, ask questions\, and d
 evelop both technical skills creative vision.\n\nPhotographers of all expe
 rience levels are welcome\, and any smartphone camera may be used. Demonst
 rations will be presented on a newer iPhone\, but the concepts and techniq
 ues apply to virtually all modern smartphones.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/phone-photography-october-2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
