 sa Grande HS!**\n\n\\-----------------------------------------------------
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n*
 *Daily Acts and Casa Grande High School are teaming up to transform grass 
 to gardens in front of the school!** This summer we sheet mulched 3 secti
 ons of lawn and fall is the right time to to get native & climate appro
 priate plantings in the ground for winter rains!\n\n*Together\, we’ll 
 create a water-wise landscape that will build habitat and bring beauty to
  the school community for years to come.*\n\n**NOTE**: **All are welcome**
  (including children with adult supervision) and no experience needed\n\
 nCome for some\, or come for all --  we will gather rain or shine!\n\n\\
