 med gifts and more. This class will help you get started early and be pr
 epared for gift giving and holiday success. Everyone will learn to make a 
 new lantern. Fun and laughs will also be included.\n\nInterested in spendi
 ng a bit more time in the studio with Lynn Wood? This session\, opt-in for
  and additional 1.5 hours of guided working time each class session in the
  studio with Lynn Wood for an extra fee. Regularly scheduled class will oc
 cur from 10am-1pm\, and then our additional Guided Working Session with Ly
