 d laughing with the local comedy community at Wednesday Night Comedy Open 
 Mic at Barrel Proof Lounge in Downtown Santa Rosa .\n\nThis is a lively\, 
 welcoming open mic that draws comedians from all over the Bay Area and bey
 ond. Whether you’re getting on stage or just grabbing a drink and enjoyi
 ng the show\, it’s always a fun\, unpredictable night.\n\nNo cover (2-dr
 ink minimum)  Free popcorn  21+\n\nComedian Info: • Pre-signups open a
 t 10am via the BACN Facebook group • Limited 6:00pm in-person signups 
 • 6:30pm bucket draw for set order • 3–4 minute sets (light at 1 min
 ute remaining) • Hosted by Jon Lehre\n\nIt’s a great room for comics 
 — and a great show even if you never touch the mic.\n\nCheck out **www.b
 arrelprooflounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
