BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blind Scream Haunted House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T230000
UID:260921TdgnjBLeNkWga7XMQETENQ
DESCRIPTION:Open 13 nights only\, join the Doc and his family and step int
 o over 20\,000 square feet of haunted horror in the heart of Santa Rosa. T
 his year we have 2 distinct haunts for you to sink your teeth into.\n\nBli
 nd Scream Haunted House features the all new Caverns of Carnage where wind
 ing tunnels\, claustrophobic chambers\, and forgotten caverns have danger 
 lurking around every corner. The deeper you go\, the harder it becomes to 
 tell what’s part of the cave and what’s watching you from within it.\n
 \nBLACKOUT Haunted House is a pitch-black maze. All you have to guide your
  way is one glow stick… and the creatures stalking your every step. Ever
 y sense will be tested. Every turn is a challenge. And one wrong move… t
 he scream is yours.\n\nFeed your terrors today and get your tickets before
  it's too late. Once the 13 nights are gone\, the haunt disappears until n
 ext year!\n\n**Location** - 98 Santa Rosa Plaza\, Downtown Santa Rosa (at 
 the corners of 1st Street and A Street). South of the Santa Rosa Plaza par
 king garage.
LOCATION:Blind Scream Haunted House
URL:https://www.blindscream.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Connect W/ Jenessa: Psychic Medium - Super SexyHalloween + DJ Afte
 r Party!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T010000
UID:2609115t7lTHxQMU2sGphkljyu4g
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a sexy evening with Psychic Medium Jenessa in
  Santa Rosa as she delivers messages from beyond the veil! DJ Decks after!
 \n\nDoors 6:00 PM | Show 7:00 PM | 21+\n\nSlip on your sexiest spookiest e
 nsemble and join us for an unforgettable night with Northern California’
 s #1 psychic medium\, Jenessa \, right here at Barrel Proof Lounge in Down
 town Santa Rosa.\n\nJenessa has captivated audiences across the Bay with h
 er uncanny ability to deliver heartfelt messages from beyond—while keepi
 ng everyone laughing with her sharp wit and playful energy. Expect tears o
 f joy\, goosebumps\, and plenty of laughs as she connects with the audienc
 e in this one-of-a-kind live show.\n\n Tickets: - General Admission: $35 
 advance | $49 at the door - VIP Table for 4: $189 — includes a bottle of
  wine\, bubbly\, or a round of drinks + your own server call button\n\nSea
 ting is limited and this show will sell out fast —don’t wait to snag y
 our spot!\n\nJenessa will be performing for 90+ minutes and randomly readi
 ng members of the audience (with permission). While many people will get a
  reading\, we cannot guarantee everyone will.\n\nStick around for a sexy c
 ostume dance party with DJ Decks at 10!  Beer\, wine\, Soju cocktails\, a
 nd free popcorn all night long.  Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendocino Ave\
 , downtown Santa Rosa  21+ only\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com*
 * for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://JanessaHalloween.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
