BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Slow Looking in the Gallery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T140000
UID:260715u6tJBOqo-ky_k1afQjSFXA
DESCRIPTION:Slow Looking is an intentional practice of spending a longer p
 eriod of time with a single piece of work. We will have a brief check-in c
 onversation and then engage in at least two slow looking experiences each 
 week. Slow looking goes beyond art appreciation. Research has identified c
 ognitive\, physiological\, and emotional benefits including: Stress Reduct
 ion and Relaxation Enhanced Cognitive Engagement Emotional Depth and Empat
 hy Improved Observational Skills Mindfulness Psychological support Increas
 ed Perceived Beauty Social Connectedness No special knowledge of art or ar
 tists required\, just a sense of curiosity. Some people find it useful to 
 bring a journal or sketchbook as part of their looking tools. Some basic a
 rt materials will be available.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/slow-looking-in-the-gallery-fridays-1
 -2pm/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:True West
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T203000
UID:260715p6oHxoyNgkCWVtB-JnVjlA
DESCRIPTION:Set in a suburban California home\, True West follows two brot
 hers with sharply contrasting personalities who reunite while house-sittin
 g for their mother. One is a disciplined\, aspiring screenwriter\, while t
 he other lives a more nomadic and unpredictable life. As they reconnect\, 
 their interactions shift from uneasy familiarity to intense competition\, 
 fueled by conflicting ambitions and long-standing tensions. Shepard's play
  delves into themes of authenticity\, creativity\, and the myth of the Ame
 rican frontier\, using sharp dialogue and dark humor to reveal the instabi
 lity beneath the surface of everyday life. As the brothers' dynamic evolve
 s\, the boundaries between their identities begin to blur\, raising questi
 ons about who they are and what defines them.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/true-west/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
