DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T203000
UID:260925skGtoQVoxkaTq0yVNf9b1w
DESCRIPTION:What if we could grow the materials we build with? Join AIA Re
 dwood Empire for an evening with architect Chris Maurer\, founder of redho
 use studio\, as he explores how mycelium\, the root-like network of mushro
 oms\, can become a building material. From NASA-supported research into sp
 ace habitats to his Mycohab initiative in Namibia\, Maurer’s work offers
  a look at how architecture can turn waste into useful materials and reduc
 e its environmental impact. All are welcome.
LOCATION:Lavish Experience Center
