DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing Highway 12 Band & Lila’s Streetside Eats\n\nJoin us for a lively 
 Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downto
 wn Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold stree
 t-style food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the high-energy\, crowd-
 pleasing sounds of Highway 12 Band with the flavorful dishes of Lila’s S
 treetside Eats.\n\nHighway 12 Band brings a fun mix of danceable hits and 
 familiar favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and soc
 ial evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboar
 d’s wines by the glass or bottle while Lila’s Streetside Eats serves f
 resh\, creative street food made to order and packed with flavor.\n\nFrida
 y | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 even
 t inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on 
 the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma Count
 y night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available fo
 r purchase Live music by Highway 12 Band Food by Lila’s Streetside Eats 
 \\(street-style comfort food\\) Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room 
 Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard VIneyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
